# What may sit in this repository and what may ship: plugins/ChanSampler/MEASUREMENTS.md "Provenance".
# vendor words: never in a control label, preset name, file name or plug-in name
vendor: Image-Line, FL Studio, FL Sampler, Channel Sampler, Fruity, Edison, Slicex
# files the check would stop, kept with their reason
allow: plugins/ChanSampler/tests/data/state-1.2.0.bin  a project state saved by Chan Sampler 1.2.0 itself, for the host test that old projects load unchanged (approved 2026-11-01)
allow: measurements/ChanSampler/  the measured data of the null tests and measurement scripts (kernels, matrices, curves, tables of our own; no render and no file FL wrote), published (approval recorded 2026-11-09)
allow: plugins/ChanSampler/Source/PresetImport.cpp  reads .fst presets from the musician's own library and finds their samples in their own FL Studio folders, for compatibility (approved 2026-11-01)
